{
  "name": "@thoremin/ext-faces",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "thoremin's face categorizer extension (#330): record a session of your own faces, carve it into categories, name them (defaults from the general expression model, one-to-one), and save several. Instruments read a saved one in place of the general model (P4). A LAZY extension: imports only the SDK packages. TypeScript source, consumed through the workspace.",
